---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About [Your Name] — a product management student at [University].">

  <section class="about-hero content-width">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>The kind of PM who asks "why" before "what."</h1>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <div class="about-body content-width">
    <div class="bio">
      <p>
        I'm [Your Name], a rising junior at [University] studying Computer Science
        and Human-Centered Design. I'm targeting APM programs at large tech companies
        for summer 2027.
      </p>
      <p>
        My background sits at the intersection of building and understanding — I can read
        a database schema and I can conduct a user interview, and I think both skills
        belong in the same room when a product decision gets made.
      </p>
      <p>
        What drives me is the full loop: listening carefully enough to locate the real
        user pain (which is rarely the one described in the first conversation), designing
        for the experience rather than just the feature, making prioritization calls under
        real constraints, and actually measuring whether anything changed.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of product work, [add one or two honest personal details — a hobby,
        something you're curious about, something that makes you a person and not a resume].
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-aside">
      <div class="aside-block">
        <p class="aside-label">Currently</p>
        <p>[University], Class of [Year]</p>
        <p>Studying CS + Human-Centered Design</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aside-block">
        <p class="aside-label">Seeking</p>
        <p>APM Internships — Summer 2027</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aside-block">
        <p class="aside-label">Interested in</p>
        <p>[2–3 product domains or problem areas you care about]</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-ctas">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn">Get in touch →</a>
      <a href="[your LinkedIn URL]" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding: 5.5rem 0 3.5rem;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.125rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding: 4rem 0 5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    gap: 3rem 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .bio {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bio p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-aside {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .aside-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .aside-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .aside-block p:not(.aside-label) {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .about-ctas {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-aside {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 2;
      padding-top: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .about-ctas {
      grid-row: 3;
    }
  }
</style>
